{"html":"<div class=\"ck-content\">\n    <p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1. M\u1ee5c ti\u00eau: <\/strong>n\u1eafm \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c 18 ch\u1eef h\u00e1n.&nbsp;<\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem; text-transform: inherit;\">2. C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac:<\/strong><span style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem; text-transform: inherit;\"> g\u1ed3m 3 m\u1ee5c l\u00e0 xem video gi\u1ea3i th\u00edch ch\u1eef H\u00e1n, Drill luy\u1ec7n t\u1eadp v\u00e0 Test x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem; text-transform: inherit;\">[U14-P4]\u30d3\u30c7\u30aa\uff1a\u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 ph\u1ea7n xem video gi\u1ea3i th\u00edch ch\u1eef H\u00e1n trong b\u00e0i.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem; text-transform: inherit;\">[U14-P4]\u30c9\u30ea\u30eb\uff1a\u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 ph\u1ea7n luy\u1ec7n t\u1eadp ch\u1eef H\u00e1n trong b\u00e0i.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem; text-transform: inherit;\">[U14-P4]\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\uff1a\u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 ph\u1ea7n l\u00e0m b\u00e0i ki\u1ec3m tra.<\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem; text-transform: inherit;\">&nbsp;<strong>* L\u01b0u \u00fd:<\/strong> h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tham kh\u1ea3o danh s\u00e1ch ch\u1eef H\u00e1n \u1edf d\u01b0\u1edbi video tr\u01b0\u1edbc\/ trong khi xem.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>3. \u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh part:<\/strong>\r\n- H\u1ecdc vi\u00ean xem h\u1ebft c\u00e1c video v\u00e0 ph\u1ea7n gi\u1ea3i th\u00edch ch\u1eef h\u00e1n b\u00ean d\u01b0\u1edbi m\u1ed7i video, t\u00edch v\u00e0o m\u1ee5c \"done\" (ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh)\r\n- Ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh c\u00e1c b\u00e0i t\u1eadp trong ph\u1ea7n Drill luy\u1ec7n t\u1eadp v\u00e0 Test 